@startuml
[*] --> "Task Created" : When a new task is created
"Task Created" --> "Task Type and Priority Assigned" : System assigns task type and priority
"Task Type and Priority Assigned" --> "Task List Generated" : System generates task list with assigned details
"Task List Generated" --> "Task List Displayed" : Display task list to user
"Task List Displayed" --> [*] : Process completes
@enduml
